---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Bimbingan & Konseling (BK) - SMA Negeri Alor Kecil</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 antialiased font-sans">
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-4 px-6">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
        <a href="/" class="font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800">&larr; Kembali ke Beranda</a>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">SMA Negeri Alor Kecil</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
      <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Layanan Pendampingan</span>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">Bimbingan & Konseling (BK)</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2">Mendampingi perkembangan kepribadian, sosial, gaya belajar, dan rencana karir siswa.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🎓</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">Konsultasi Studi Lanjut & Karir</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Pendampingan pemilihan jurusan SNBP, persiapan SNBT, pendaftaran sekolah kedinasan, TNI/Polri, dan pemetaan dunia kerja.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🛡️</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">Layanan Pengaduan & Anti-Perundungan</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Pusat penanganan kasus kekerasan fisik maupun verbal (Tim Pencegahan dan Penanganan Kekerasan / TPPK) sekolah secara rahasia dan aman.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>